    <link=\"mailto:croberson3518@gmail.com\"><sprite=1></link>\nProject Lead, Front-End
    Developer, Asset Creator\n\nTreonna Gardner <link=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/treonna-gardner-323b18256/\"><sprite=0></link>
    <link=\"mailto:trebg.22@gmail.com\"><sprite=1></link>\nLead Programmer, Back-End
    Developer\n\nJes Crouch <link=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jessica-crouch-9b4384247/\"><sprite=0></link>
    <link=\"mailto:jessicafcrouch@gmail.com\"><sprite=1></link>\nFront-End Developer,
    Asset Creator\n\nJose Landaverde <link=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jlandvrd17/\"><sprite=0></link>
    <link=\"mailto:jose_landabrador@outlook.com\"><sprite=1></link>\nBack-End Developer,
    Asset Creator \n\nJake Lashley \nBack-End Developer\n\n<b>Spring 2026 Team</b>\nImplementation
    of the online multiplayer functionality and improvements to AI Racer's navagation\n\nWilliam
